      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIJINKERY (2) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 3.5 lengths win at Gawler in a handy 31.02. Draws to advantage and likes the trip. Expected to go well again. ZINFANDEL TREV (6) is worth forgiving for his last effort when fourth (35.83) at Angle Park over 595m. Won at his only start from this draw. Key player if finds best. JAZZY HOPE (1) finished well back at The Meadows last time when a 7 length fifth (30.99) but recorded best time of the card when winning four back. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. BOOKALOO (4) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
